<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating of Kent Electronics Corp to buy from its previous rating of neutral, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Kent closed at 22-1/8 on Monday.</p>
</text>
